      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "The harbour room",
      "content": "Vivienne rents a modest fictional room overlooking the Halewick ferry landing. Her cream cloak hangs beside a badly repaired kite; a square table can serve supper or a board game. It is her home setting, not a barracks or a shrine to duty. An invited scene can take place there without assuming the user has been rescued, recruited, or living with her previously.",
