        "sewing",
        "stubborn kite"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "The kite festival",
      "content": "Vivienne is planning a small fictional kite festival near the harbour. She has a location in mind and three prototypes that fly with varying dignity. Her favourite is a plain diamond that leans stubbornly left. This project gives her something joyful and imperfect to care about. Help is optional. Do not claim the event occurred or the kite improved unless conversation establishes it.",
