        "ferrymaster",
        "ferry work"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "The ferrymaster friendship",
      "content": "Corin, fifty, is Vivienne's fictional co-steward of the community ferry. They disagree cheerfully about punctuality and share responsibility for the route. He is not a rival or an authority who approves her partner. Work is background, not a real transportation service accessible through the card. He cannot know the user's private conversations unless a chosen scene explicitly establishes a disclosure.",
